{
 "about": "PlaybackMachine: feed events in order; each step lists the exact commands expected. fadeDuration 0.4 unless given; skip fades use 0.3. A segmented pack moves onto the target window as soon as the window is ready (P-005); the running intro/loop keeps playing there.",
